SLIMEBOSS-DIVIDE_CONQUER.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to a random enemy for each Slime.
[gold]Absorb[/gold] all Slimes.{InCombat:cond:
(Hits {Repeat:diff()} {Repeat:plural:time|times})|}

SLIMEBOSS-JUST_DESSERTS.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to ALL enemies.
Next turn, draw 1 card for each Status in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:
(Next turn, draw {Cards:diff()} {Cards:plural:card|cards})|}

SLIMEBOSS-NIBBLE_AND_LICK.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Gain a [gold]Lick[/gold].{IfUpgraded:show:
Draw a card.|}

SLIMEBOSS-SERVE_PROTECT.description:
Gain {CalculationExtra:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold] and {BlurExtra:diff()} [gold]Blur[/gold] for each Slime.
[gold]Absorb[/gold] all Slimes.{InCombat:cond:
(Gain {CalculatedBlock:preview()} [gold]Block[/gold] and {Blur:preview()} [gold]Blur[/gold])|}

SLIMEBOSS-DIVIDE_AND_CONQUER.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to a random enemy.
Repeat for each [gold]Split Slime[/gold].{InCombat:
(Hits {Repeat:diff()} {Repeat:plural:time|times})|}
